    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30165" body-key="">
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκατα-μείγνῡμι</span></b> 
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ύω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Lex.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			), <i>mix with</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τινι</span>
			Timo <i><span class="en">
				33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Hist.Conscr.</u>
				13
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρμακον πότῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ach.Tat.
					4.15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰς λόχοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					6.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτοὺς τοῖς στρατιώταις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					7.12.7
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέντρον τωθασμοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.570
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεὸν ἀνθρωπίναις χρείαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.414f
				</span></i>
			; of a sculptor, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μανίην λίθῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>APl.</u>
					4.57
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Paul.Sil.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.593
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be mixed in</i> or <i>with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκαταμειγνύμενος ὕδατι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			<i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκαταμεμιγμένα τοῖς λεγομένοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					15.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνόματα -μιγέντα τῇ λέξει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Comp.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			.</div>
